@anon.a2b023d1a4e2834952d16152dce23780.661 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [484 x i8] }> <{ [484 x i8] c"A list of terms and their descriptions.\0A\0ADisplays a sequence of terms and their descriptions vertically. When the\0Adescriptions span over multiple lines, they use hanging indent to\0Acommunicate the visual hierarchy.\0A\0A# Example\0A```example\0A/ Ligature: A merged glyph.\0A/ Kerning: A spacing adjustment\0A  between two adjacent letters.\0A```\0A\0A# Syntax\0AThis function also has dedicated syntax: Starting a line with a slash,\0Afollowed by a term, a colon and a description creates a term list item." }>, align 1
