@anon.a2b023d1a4e2834952d16152dce23780.985 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [438 x i8] }> <{ [438 x i8] c"Makes a color more opaque by a given scale.\0A\0AThis method is relative to the existing alpha value.\0AIf the scale is positive, calculates `alpha + scale - alpha * scale`.\0ANegative scales behave like `color.transparentize(-scale)`.\0A\0A```example\0A#let half-red = red.transparentize(50%)\0A#block(fill: half-red.opacify(100%))[opaque]\0A#block(fill: half-red.opacify(50%))[three quarters red]\0A#block(fill: half-red.opacify(-50%))[one quarter red]\0A```" }>, align 1
